		lineageTag: 7cf709f6-88fb-44af-a9cd-24bf9dd9a8ad
		summarizeBy: none
		sourceColumn: Macro Offer Label

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

		annotation Description = "Display label combining macro offer name with year-over-year variance indicator (Δ vs LY). For visual display only. Proposed – pending Loro Piana validation."

